      "correct": true,
      "text": "Activate Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose data transformation. When configuring the delivery stream, specify the DeliveryStreamType property. Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose will call the chosen Lambda function asynchronously for log conversion into JSON format. The Lambda invocation time is allowed up to 30 minutes. Subsequently, data scientists can utilize services such as Amazon Athena and QuickSight for SQL querying and analytics.",
