      "text": "Set up Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose data transformation with the DeliveryStreamType parameter set as KinesisStreamAsSource, while designating the AWS CloudWatch Logs SubscriptionFilter destination as the Firehose stream ARN. Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose allows a Lambda invocation time up to 30 minutes. Data scientists can use Amazon Athena and QuickSight for further data analysis.",
